OL,3,GNEWSACharity gifts Eden Project
OL,4,AMorecambe #2.5m
OL,5,
OL,6,FEden Project Morecambe has received a
OL,7,F#2.5m investment from a charitable
OL,8,Ffoundation.
OL,10,FThe eco attraction set for the
OL,11,FLancashire seaside resort is expected
OL,12,Fto open in 2028.
OL,14,FThe donation from the Pears Foundation
OL,15,Fwill help to fund the attraction's
OL,16,Fhabitations zone, designed to inspire
OL,17,Fvisitors to explore more sustainable
OL,18,Fways of living.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
