OL,3,GNEWSACharity gifts Eden Project
OL,4,AMorecambe #2.5m
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Jasper, chief executive of charity
OL,7,FEden Project, said the "milestone" gift
OL,8,Fwould leave a "lasting, tangible and
OL,9,Ftransformational legacy for Morecambe,
OL,10,Ffor communities across the North West
OL,11,Fand the UK".
